{"data":{"listItems":[{"id":"aca5e692-9b05-4881-9147-11a1e580de5e","slug":"the-death-of-window-shopping","title":"The death of window shopping","description":"When AI agents only buy what you request and social algorithms only echo past habits, where does that leave spontaneity? Cart.com co-founder Remington Tonar defends the digital storefront and cart—not as relic tools of the past, but as essential engines for emotional buying, unexpected discovery, and critical intent data in an automated world.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:35:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:55:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"f42e279b-efba-48af-b96b-906241065ce2","name":"Stage 4","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"db5c3e34-33f6-4d99-8c3c-edd888d51127","name":"Remington Tonar","company_name":"Cart.com","job_title":"Co-Founder & Chief Growth Officer","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/0gb7zop5hgd3s4icir7vup42axvo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/0gb7zop5hgd3s4icir7vup42axvo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/0gb7zop5hgd3s4icir7vup42axvo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/0gb7zop5hgd3s4icir7vup42axvo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/0gb7zop5hgd3s4icir7vup42axvo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"d9f6f9d0-e8f5-419c-9b4b-673f13f290a4","name":"David Savage","company_name":"Harvey Nash","job_title":"Podcast Host & Group Technology Evangelist","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2c4kabysqbrceye1jjqg0w3aql3b?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2c4kabysqbrceye1jjqg0w3aql3b?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2c4kabysqbrceye1jjqg0w3aql3b?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2c4kabysqbrceye1jjqg0w3aql3b?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2c4kabysqbrceye1jjqg0w3aql3b?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Commerce Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"5f97343c-8243-4569-b68d-c07311570728","slug":"the-race-to-zero","title":"The race to zero","description":"In October, MiniMax launched M3.1 Flash, a model built for AI agents that it says runs three times faster and cuts agent costs by 70%. As China’s labs push the price of intelligence towards zero, Europe faces a choice: build its own, or plug in. Alan Shen, MiniMax’s Global MD and GM for EMEA, joins us. When intelligence becomes a commodity, who captures the value?","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:35:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:55:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"90a7d849-c0d0-473d-becf-b9cab8096e3d","name":"Stage 13","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"358dd86a-b972-4168-bb8a-993728b68251","name":"Alan Shen","company_name":"MiniMax","job_title":"MD Global","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/qabj1y2y8l9db0zr7zc9qtip9ck5?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/qabj1y2y8l9db0zr7zc9qtip9ck5?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/qabj1y2y8l9db0zr7zc9qtip9ck5?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/qabj1y2y8l9db0zr7zc9qtip9ck5?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/qabj1y2y8l9db0zr7zc9qtip9ck5?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"AI Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"b87caf7e-ebcf-4f16-8c18-a82162c93686","slug":"the-physical-shadow-of-the-digital-economy","title":"The physical shadow of the digital economy","description":"AI agents can decide what to buy in milliseconds. But whatever they order still moves through a physical supply chain built over decades. Valentyn Frechka, inventor of a process that turns urban fallen leaves into paper packaging, argues that some of the biggest opportunities hide in the gaps between existing systems, and shares what it takes to turn one such connection into something that works at industrial scale.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:40:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:50:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"a871cf88-732c-432d-8969-1226f4fc575b","name":"Stage 9","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"c04847c9-1a1a-4e51-b974-3991547a2d86","name":"Valentyn Frechka","company_name":"Releaf Paper ®","job_title":"Founder & CEO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2ijieccfh5b2pslml311v7cor79x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2ijieccfh5b2pslml311v7cor79x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2ijieccfh5b2pslml311v7cor79x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2ijieccfh5b2pslml311v7cor79x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/2ijieccfh5b2pslml311v7cor79x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Growth Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"ae54c818-b908-46ef-9ca3-c3430805a735","slug":"ai-needs-ground-to-stand-on","title":"AI needs ground to stand on","description":"When an AI agent dispatches a delivery, triages an insurance claim, or prices the risk on a building in a flood plain, reasoning over text alone isn't enough. The decision has to be grounded in the physical world: where things are, how they're changing, and what's true right now. TomTom's Leo Sei shows what an agent needs to know about a place, at a time, before its decision survives contact with reality, as well as why one trusted location intelligence layer sits under logistics and insurance alike.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:40:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"685b779a-20e7-4280-b402-b239764fb6d6","name":"Stage 10","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"bc9999bf-20eb-4aa5-9649-727f00b65f2f","name":"Leo Sei","company_name":"TomTom","job_title":"SVP","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ty537s03y8ut2j04psiineiiy6v4?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ty537s03y8ut2j04psiineiiy6v4?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ty537s03y8ut2j04psiineiiy6v4?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ty537s03y8ut2j04psiineiiy6v4?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ty537s03y8ut2j04psiineiiy6v4?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Developer Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"9ea6a9b1-59e2-45e2-8f36-cb97527c939c","slug":"reclaiming-human-agency-in-the-machine-era","title":"Reclaiming human agency in the machine era","description":"As AI models threaten to reduce humans to passive consumers of automated content, entrepreneurship remains our most powerful outlet for agency and purpose. Join Bill Gross as he presents a compelling framework for human-AI collaboration: software identifies the opportunity and drafts the blueprint, while human founders bring the empathy, grit, and execution required to bring it to life in the real world.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:40:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"a2df2c35-bb0e-4872-a9e2-14c8aaa17d83","name":"Centre Stage","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"0a567ac8-c55f-4ff7-b35f-6b1cb46f9864","name":"Bill Gross","company_name":"Idealab","job_title":"Co-founder & Chairman","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/u86yh79yobr8yee6kp8uvrpv8ld3?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/u86yh79yobr8yee6kp8uvrpv8ld3?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/u86yh79yobr8yee6kp8uvrpv8ld3?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/u86yh79yobr8yee6kp8uvrpv8ld3?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/u86yh79yobr8yee6kp8uvrpv8ld3?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"64d65138-559d-443b-bc9a-3b2e67243dcc","name":"Blake Montgomery","company_name":"The Guardian US","job_title":"Tech Editor","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8aynqky92tiswg1r6vi4vatzfk4x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8aynqky92tiswg1r6vi4vatzfk4x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8aynqky92tiswg1r6vi4vatzfk4x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8aynqky92tiswg1r6vi4vatzfk4x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8aynqky92tiswg1r6vi4vatzfk4x?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Centre Stage","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"81b9d32e-2629-42af-b870-a71a838d22bd","slug":"from-local-to-limitless-why-creativity-should-know-no-boundaries","title":"From local to limitless: Why creativity should know no boundaries","description":"What if your best creative ideas could travel anywhere, across borders, cultures and even into space? This talk explores how creative AI is helping brands overcome traditional barriers to growth, reimagining existing campaigns for new audiences without losing what makes them distinctive. The session finishes with a live demonstration using Web Summit itself, transforming its Lisbon identity for globally recognised locations before taking the event somewhere entirely unexpected: outer space.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:40:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"716e89fb-86fe-4af9-a8c8-05a779333998","name":"Stage 14","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"0e646706-8e3c-48c4-aa8f-fd54fc6b61a5","name":"Johnny Rohrbach","company_name":"Silverside AI","job_title":"Co-founder","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/xeh0rlwq9uu5rotm6pfqtyt3v39t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/xeh0rlwq9uu5rotm6pfqtyt3v39t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/xeh0rlwq9uu5rotm6pfqtyt3v39t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/xeh0rlwq9uu5rotm6pfqtyt3v39t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/xeh0rlwq9uu5rotm6pfqtyt3v39t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Marketing Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"6d310f57-0a23-4602-a792-5e3d3c654a29","slug":"navigating-ai-in-european-health","title":"Navigating AI in European health","description":"Bridging frontier AI research with national health system execution, this session explores the operational realities, regulatory shifts, and governance required to deploy agentic AI safely across European healthcare.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:40:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"ca314426-f597-44d0-b3cd-f3017a2bbcb4","name":"Stage 5","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"3f41ce34-2808-43de-bda7-725f2655b351","name":"Aldo Faisal","company_name":"UKRI Centres in AI for Health at Imperial College London","job_title":"Professor and Director","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/bxmujzdhjbcddnbelwob8y3r93ur?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/bxmujzdhjbcddnbelwob8y3r93ur?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/bxmujzdhjbcddnbelwob8y3r93ur?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/bxmujzdhjbcddnbelwob8y3r93ur?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/bxmujzdhjbcddnbelwob8y3r93ur?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"b15a9d30-1c3d-432a-899c-4092e4419323","name":"Dr. Luís Filipe Loureiro Goes Pinheiro","company_name":"SPMS","job_title":"Chairman of the Board of Directors","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engi